The Rust source could not be compiled in this environment because no Rust toolchain is installed and container networking is disabled, so I couldn't install rustup. I included that explicitly in STATUS.md rather than pretending it was compiled. The workspace includes the intended CI gate: cargo fmt, strict Clippy, workspace tests and conformance tests.

The deeper product is now very clear to me:

Cogym doesn't sell prompts. A Cogym School discovers experimentally validated ways of making agents think/behave usefully, stores the cumulative intelligence, and sells cheap ways of accessing or instantiating that learned cognition.